# Migration Scripts Directory

Place your migration files here with the naming convention:
`YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS_description.js`

Example: `20241216_120000_add_youtube_field.js`

## Migration File Template

```javascript
/**
 * Migration: Add YouTube URL field to projects
 * Date: 2024-12-16
 */

module.exports = {
  async up(mongoose) {
    // Your migration logic here
    const Project = mongoose.model('Project');
    
    // Example: Add new field to all documents
    await Project.updateMany(
      { youtubeUrl: { $exists: false } },
      { $set: { youtubeUrl: '' } }
    );
    
    console.log('✅ Added youtubeUrl field to all projects');
  },
  
  async down(mongoose) {
    // Rollback logic (optional)
    const Project = mongoose.model('Project');
    
    await Project.updateMany(
      {},
      { $unset: { youtubeUrl: '' } }
    );
    
    console.log('✅ Removed youtubeUrl field from all projects');
  }
};
```
